== Obtaining ==
=== Farming ===
'''Nether Wart''' can be harvested at the {{Zone|Farm}}, the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}} or {{Zone|The Garden}}.

=== Minions ===
'''Nether Wart''' can be generated by {{Item|Nether Wart Minion}}s.

=== Shop Purchase ===
'''Nether Wart''' can be bought from the {{NPCSprite|Alchemist}} for {{c|10}} each or from {{NPCSprite|Ulyn}} or {{NPCSprite|An}} for {{c|25}} each.

